# Original examples; named and deictic references require context.json.
du-eat se child-u ob cookie-a
du-eat ob cookie-a se child-u
di-see se me ob man-e vi telescope-e
di-see se me ob man-e ke di-hold se re ob telescope-e ek
ka-ob wi-eat se cat-e
# Scope survives canonical role reordering.
du-give se teacher-u to child-u ob book-a
du-give se teacher-u ob book-a to child-u
# Three different placements of negation.
no-du-eat se child-u ob cookie-a
du-eat se child-u ne ob cookie-a
du-eat ne se child-u ob cookie-a
# Noun negation, aspect, modifiers, pluralities, and kinds.
du-eat se child-u ob no-cookie-a
du-eat-en-ing se me ob apple-a
du-sleep se cat-a ma-small ma-black
du-sleep se cat-i
du-sleep se cat-o
du-flow se water
ka di-see se re-John ob re-OtherJohn
# The innermost relative can explicitly address an outer head.
di-see se me ob man-a ke di-see se re ob woman-a ke di-help se re ob re-2 ek ek
